# Task Tags & Status Discipline
Allowed statuses: open | in_progress | blocked | done
Priority scale: P0 (urgent) .. P3 (low)

Rules:
- You may move a task to in_progress only if all deps are done.
- You may mark done only if acceptance criteria are verified (tests or evidence).
- If a dependency is missing or failing, set status=blocked and write a one-line reason.
- Keep /ops/tasks.yaml the single source of truth; never invent tasks without appending them there.